{"route":{"id":"17455","name":"Itinerari pel passat miner d'Ogassa","intro":"<strong>Poques rutes trobarem tan variades com aquesta</strong>. Sortirem del monestir de Sant Joan, creuarem <strong>boscos de pi roig i roures</strong>, i gaudirem de<strong> vistes úniques</strong> fins a arribar al poble miner d<strong>'Ogassa. Un poble amb encant</strong> que encara conserva restes del seu passat (i present) miner. Pel camí de tornada descobrirem com s'extreia el carbó i com es transportava; <strong>caminarem per camins plens d'història i natura</strong>.","tipus":"Circular horari","dificultat":"Mitjana","durada":"3 hores 20 minuts","desnivell":"600.00 meters","distancia":"11.50 km","tema":"Flora i fauna, Geologia, Paisatgístic","imgs":["n17455_1.jpg","n17455_2.jpg","n17455_3.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme-girona/rutes-senderisme-sant-joan-de-les-abadesses/itinerari-pel-passat-miner-dogassa","track":[[42.23287,2.28739],[42.23285,2.28697],[42.23319,2.28673],[42.23346,2.28647],[42.2336,2.28635],[42.23375,2.28629],[42.23385,2.28626],[42.23394,2.28616],[42.23397,2.28599],[42.23402,2.28592],[42.2341,2.28588],[42.23423,2.2858],[42.23431,2.28568],[42.23467,2.28546],[42.23476,2.28533],[42.2348,2.2852],[42.23486,2.28504],[42.23491,2.28489],[42.23496,2.28476],[42.23501,2.28465],[42.2351,2.28448],[42.23519,2.28435],[42.23522,2.2842],[42.23531,2.28409],[42.23545,2.284],[42.23558,2.28403],[42.23574,2.284],[42.23587,2.284],[42.23597,2.28402],[42.23605,2.28412],[42.2362,2.28413],[42.23634,2.28421],[42.23645,2.28427],[42.23656,2.28427],[42.23667,2.28425],[42.23677,2.28419],[42.23689,2.28389],[42.23686,2.28363],[42.23679,2.28337],[42.23671,2.28311],[42.23679,2.28293],[42.23689,2.28297],[42.23697,2.2828],[42.23706,2.28265],[42.23715,2.28252],[42.23725,2.28239],[42.23741,2.28236],[42.23754,2.28235],[42.23767,2.28241],[42.23782,2.28245],[42.23795,2.28248],[42.23806,2.28245],[42.23819,2.28239],[42.23828,2.28231],[42.23838,2.28225],[42.23